# East-game (Tonpuu) South 4 ends unconditionally when dealer does not repeat even below 30,000
# (engine.md §5 steps 4/5, rules.md §1 extension_max_round).
# South 4, dealer 3, scores: 26000 25000 25000 24000.
# Exhaustive draw with 0 tenpai -> dealer does not repeat; next wind would be West (beyond extension) ->
# game ends immediately even though max score is 26000 < 30000!
# Final ranks: 0, 1, 2, 3 (S1 and S2 tied at 25000, seat 1 > seat 2).
# Mahjong Soul adjusted scores: +16000, +5000, -5000, -16000.

